        },
        {
          "text": "Bar’ i Kadeshi, Mose atuma intumwa ku mwami wa Edomu, ngo zimubgire, zit’ Isirayeli murumunawe ng’ Urazi amagorwa babonye yose, ",
          "type": "text",
