              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo N’ubemerere bace mu gihugu cawe; ngo Ntibazogira umurima cank’ uruzabibu bacamwo, canke ngo banywe ku mazi yo mu mariba; ngo Bazogumya inzira y’iroro, ngo Ntibazokevya ngo baje i buryo cank’ i bumoso, gushitsa aho bazorangiriza igihugu cawe.",
          "type": "text",
